	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D. P.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Alacriori animo<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">animo <hi>Fehlt in der Vorlage.</hi></note> tuas, charissime pater, literas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Ein nicht erhaltener Brief <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName>.</note> recepi quam legerim.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Causas tenes, nec est, ut <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>repetam.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quas destinaras <placeName ref="l339">Neoburgum</placeName>,<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="2">Nämlich der nicht erhaltene Brief <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> an <persName ref="p8519">Hans Wunderlich (Merveilleux)</persName>, der diesem durch dessen in <placeName ref="l49">Biel</placeName> lebenden Schwiegervater, <persName ref="p7879">Niklaus Wyttenbach</persName>, hätte übermittelt werden sollen; s. <ref target="file12823">Nr. 2774</ref>,11-16; <ref target="file12843">Nr. 2794</ref>,2f.</note> <persName ref="p1057">Vulpius</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p1057">Peter Fuchs</persName>, Ratsherr in <placeName ref="l49">Biel</placeName>.</note> et ego, quanta potuimus diligentia, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>eo perferri curavimus; non enim domi erant <persName ref="p7879">Wyttenbachii</persName>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Iacobum,<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Unbestimmbar.</note> tabellionem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tuum, retinuimus, donec ille<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Unbekannt.</note> a nobis missus reverteretur; qui et literas<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Brief <ref target="file12843">Nr. 2794</ref> vom 4. Februar.</note>, ut videbis, a <persName ref="p8519">Ioanne <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Mirabili</persName> attulit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Literas ad <persName ref="p7879">Wyttenbachium</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p7879">Niklaus Wyttenbach</persName>; s. oben Anm. 2. - Dieser Brief ist nicht erhalten.</note> datas, quoniam, ut diximus, domi non est, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nondum legimus.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Valemus recte omnes gratia deo.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Atque utinam et vos valeatis!</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Interim nihil aliud quam meritas peccatorum poenas expectamus, licet deprecemur sedulo.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Non enim dici potest, quam exquisita<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Ironisch gemeint. - Vielleicht in Anlehnung an <hi><persName ref="p18356">Thomas a Kempis</persName>,</hi> De vita et beneficiis salvatoris meditationes, 5, 2, 35.</note> passim dominetur nequitia.<pb type="edition" next="263"/></s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Die maß loufft <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>schon über!<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 23, 32</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>1Thess 2, 16</ref></cit>.</note></s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Deus optimus maximus vel liberet nos a malis<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 6, 13</ref></cit>.</note> undique minantibus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>vel donet, ut patienti animo et constanti veritatis confessione gloriosi reddamur <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et evangelii cognitio latius spargatur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Ostendit nobis dominus, quod ad nos pertineant, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quae quondam ille filiis Zebedei respondit, nempe calicem amaritudinis nunc bibendum, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>olim vero regnandum, ubi deo patri visum fuerit,<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 20, 20-23</ref></cit>.</note> necdum completus est numerus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>eorum, qui propter agni confessionem sunt occidendi.<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><cit type="bible"><ref>Apk 6, 11</ref></cit>.</note></s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Deus succurrat imbecillibus!<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 8, 26</ref></cit>.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Salutant te, quos salvere iussisti omnes, atque iidem virtute mactare iubent, pro vobis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>sedulo dominum oraturi.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem meo nomine dices uxori<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="14"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> totique familię tuę necnon <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>vicinis tuis, <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandro</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName>, <persName ref="p1214">Frysio</persName>, <persName ref="p473">Buchtero</persName>, etc. patribus colendissimis.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Aeternum vale.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l49">Biellnis</placeName>, nonis februarii 1547.<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>In der Vorlage aus</hi> 1546 <hi>korrigiert.</hi></note></s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Totus ex animo tuus <persName ref="p8082">Ioannes <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Leopoldus Fry</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Piissimo doctissimoque viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>antistiti dignissimo, patri suo sum<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>me semper observando.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Der vorliegende Brief wurde zusammen mit Brief <ref target="file12843">Nr. 2794</ref> dem oben in Z. 4 erwähnten Boten Jakob [...] anvertraut.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>